[2.635, "o", "\r\n\u001b[36m\u001b[1m+====================================================================+\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m\u001b[1m|  Running: Demo 19: Docker Go                                       |\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[36m\u001b[1m+====================================================================+\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[2m\r\nDemonstrates Docker deployment with Go/Gin:\r\n  - Go application in Docker container\r\n  - Multi-stage build for smaller image\r\n  - Gin web framework\r\n  - High-performance JSON API\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
